-[STRAINED GRUNTING]
-[ALARM BLARING]

48
00:06:24,753 --> 00:06:26,889
[GUARD SHOUTING IN RUSSIAN]

49
00:06:30,559 --> 00:06:32,460
[ALARM CONTINUES BLARING]

50
00:06:32,594 --> 00:06:34,563
[GUARD SHOUTING IN RUSSIAN]

51
00:06:38,567 --> 00:06:40,702
[PANTING]

52
00:06:40,836 --> 00:06:43,272
[GUARD SHOUTING IN RUSSIAN]

53
00:06:43,404 --> 00:06:45,240
[GRUNTING]

54
00:06:46,341 --> 00:06:48,310
[GUARDS SHOUTING IN RUSSIAN]

55
00:06:48,442 --> 00:06:51,046
[AUTOMATIC GUNFIRE]

56
00:06:54,316 --> 00:06:55,416
[LAUGHING]

57
00:06:59,922 --> 00:07:02,057
[SHOUTING IN RUSSIAN]

58
00:07:02,190 --> 00:07:04,126
[STRAINED GRUNTING]

59
