788
00:57:39,928 --> 00:57:42,463
-Can it?
-Not sure.

789
00:57:42,597 --> 00:57:44,800
Put The Foreigner on this.

790
00:57:44,933 --> 00:57:46,467
He's a bit of a freak,

791
