but he's been obsessed
with The Hunter for years.

792
00:57:50,572 --> 00:57:53,842
Maybe he can figure out
what the fuck is going on.

793
00:58:06,421 --> 00:58:07,689
Hey.

794
00:58:34,316 --> 00:58:36,118
[ECHOING]
One.

795
00:58:38,153 --> 00:58:39,654
[ECHOING]
Two.

796
00:58:41,189 --> 00:58:43,158
[ECHOING]
Three.

797
00:58:53,368 --> 00:58:55,270
