854
01:02:05,026 --> 01:02:07,062
I don't hate people.

855
01:02:08,363 --> 01:02:11,866
I hate what people do,
but I don't hate people.

856
01:02:13,335 --> 01:02:17,239
I guess, then,
Papa was right about one thing.

857
01:02:17,372 --> 01:02:19,874
Yeah? What's...?

858
01:02:20,008 --> 01:02:22,545
[IMPERSONATING Nikolai]
Men should be the only animal

859
