973
01:10:10,879 --> 01:10:12,480
-[SHARP CLANG]
-[GRUNTING]

974
01:10:16,985 --> 01:10:19,755
[GASPING]

975
01:10:21,523 --> 01:10:23,559
[SCREAMING]
Dima!

976
01:10:25,627 --> 01:10:26,995
