Hello, sir.

977
01:10:27,129 --> 01:10:28,897
Is there something
I can help you with?

978
01:10:29,031 --> 01:10:30,733
A towel, maybe?

979
01:10:30,866 --> 01:10:32,101
CALYPSO:
Thank you so much.

980
01:10:32,233 --> 01:10:34,203
[SLOWLY]
Appreciate it.

981
01:10:37,706 --> 01:10:39,108
WOMAN:
Oh.

982
01:10:39,240 --> 01:10:40,642
SECURITY GUARD:
Sir.

983
01:10:40,776 --> 01:10:42,310
I think you left your shoes
in the lobby.

984
01:10:42,443 --> 01:10:44,580
-I'm pretty sure I didn't.
