986
01:10:46,048 --> 01:10:47,783
There ain't enough volts
in the world

987
01:10:47,916 --> 01:10:49,118
-there, my friend.
-Ryan.

988
01:10:49,250 --> 01:10:50,652
Everything's fine.
He's a client.

989
01:10:50,786 --> 01:10:52,921
What the hell, Sergei?

990
01:10:53,055 --> 01:10:55,389
I told you
I'd think about your offer.

991
