1010
01:11:35,697 --> 01:11:38,466
I couldn't sleep, so...

1011
01:11:38,600 --> 01:11:40,936
I left and went for a walk
and my...

1012
01:11:41,069 --> 01:11:44,006
-We're gonna find him.
-[SIGHS]

1013
