Okay?

1014
01:11:45,808 --> 01:11:49,945
I'm gonna do what I do,
get us a name.

1015
01:11:50,078 --> 01:11:54,315
And then you are going to do
what you do.

1016
01:11:54,448 --> 01:11:56,819
And we will get him back.

1017
01:11:57,820 --> 01:11:59,154
I'm looking for a mercenary

1018
01:11:59,288 --> 01:12:00,989
who just ran a kidnapping op
in London.

1019
01:12:01,123 --> 01:12:03,559
Moon-shaped scar
under his left eye.

1020
01:12:03,692 --> 01:12:06,962
Smokes Turkish cigarettes,
probably a national.

1021
01:12:07,095 --> 01:12:08,831
Find him.

1022
01:12:12,400 --> 01:12:13,936
NIKOLAI:
Sergei.

1023
01:12:14,069 --> 01:12:16,772
-Who are they?
-They would not say.

1024
01:12:16,905 --> 01:12:18,774
But you know, don't you?

1025
01:12:18,907 --> 01:12:21,342
My list of enemies is long.

1026
01:12:25,446 --> 01:12:27,115
Look what they did to him.

1027
01:12:38,260 --> 01:12:39,661
How much do they want?

1028
01:12:40,863 --> 01:12:44,233
20 million in 48 hours.

1029
01:12:47,368 --> 01:12:48,337
